# gitanimals-on-desk
===
 This is a desktop pet that detects the working status of the AI coding agent in real time and comes to life on the screen. It thinks when you type a prompt, types when a tool runs, juggles as subagents multiply, rejoices when a task is completed, and sleeps when you walk away — it's your companion during your coding sessions.
